                <pb facs="0359" n="299" sameAs="frus:frus1944Quebec/pg299"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>The only information found on this meeting is that contained in the Log, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg288">p. 288</ref>, which
                    indicates that Churchill joined Roosevelt in the latter’s map room at the
                    Citadel “for a review of the latest war news”. The discussion also included
                    naval problems in the Pacific and the difficulties of supply there.</p>
            </div>
